0..72 Comment "// Transport along a composite ending in `ua`: the cubical case table of"
73..149 Comment "// Cohen, Coquand, Huber and Mörtberg, _Cubical Type Theory: a constructive"
150..224 Comment "// interpretation of the univalence axiom_ (TYPES 2015, arXiv:1611.02108),"
225..302 Comment "// § 4.5, read at the universe. `p then ua(e)` is the transport of `p` along"
303..380 Comment "// `ua(e)` in `y. Path(Type, a, y)`, and transport along it moves the operand"
381..456 Comment "// along `p`, then applies the record\'s forward map. A first path that does"
457..527 Comment "// not compute, as `p` here, is carried on as the value it stands for."
529..600 Comment "// The circle, the presented integers, the winding number and spinning."
